    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA unique and exceptional opportunity has arisen to acquire a superb mews site (circa 362 sqm) discreetly tucked away in an envious and prestigious setting on Churchl Mews, in the very heart of Malahide Village. This outstanding location is just a short stroll from an abundance of amenities, including boutique shops, excellent schools, churches, renowned restaurants, the picturesque seafront, Malahide Castle, and the DART station.\nAccessed via secure electronic gates off Church Road, Church Mews represents one of the final opportunities to create a bespoke “forever home” in this highly sought-after enclave, offering both privacy and peace of mind.\nFull planning permission has been granted (Ref No: F23A/0679) for the construction of a striking two-storey over basement mews-style residence extending to approximately 240 sqm. The well-considered design provides for a welcoming reception hall, an elegant living room, and a spacious kitchen with adjoining utility room at ground floor level.\nThe basement level accommodates a generous family room, together with a W/C and storage room, while the first floor comprises two well-proportioned bedrooms (including a luxurious en suite) and a separate study.\nThis is a truly unique and private opportunity, and viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate its potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nSite Area - 362 Sq. Mt.\n\n\nBasement Level Area - 93 Sq. Mt.\n\n\nGround Floor Area - 93 Sq. Mt.\n\n\nUpper Floor Area - 54 Sq. Mt.\n\n\n"
      },
      {
